    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1e14975cf11c5a43f82c07ec",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但如果不摆脱所有拘束，\n我根本无法介入她们的对决。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ad87d77d4530f1d93b85e5dc383bfdda3638bc02a828e9324fe81ca67a627ac4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1072/storytimeline_501072311.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        62,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/62/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7dbc0d10bd623b47ba462601",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "有时候最后就是会演变成斗志的比拼",
      "source_fingerprint": "0f4d38fbcfcc902dc86d84c3467bb575baa561652b27ab488a27412a8b665d6c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
