    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7dd0772099af29da80f15268",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "一切都是因为我实力不足和不够成熟，\n我不能对此视而不见。",
      "source_fingerprint": "04cefd5abfc3d4a0ea4cd732142d7751ceba8d2d47018539cad45c6b63d741bc",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1072/storytimeline_501072311.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        63,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/63/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b8b58eeb9cf6ccb5f3fc775b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "当实力相近的选手互相较劲时，\n最后获胜的往往是斗志较高昂的一方。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a232d80bd098e9c5b294a452d4014c4b9221739f382eebc88f452d7ab57f5eb0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1072/storytimeline_501072311.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        64,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/64/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:78572778eeb9937e947cd8d3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "今天的比赛正好就是这种状况。\n所以我劝她不需要太悲观。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b6ab193f3f31c6b043e43e2cd6422d3041df3bf7a99521bb4f349a01b4a6e043",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1072/storytimeline_501072311.json",
      "json_path": [
