    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f822984eee5fcd6cad8a287c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "继续提升跑法和战术的水准。\n这么一来，应该就不容易再遇到\n必须解开拘束才能赢的状况。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d3036ea5c401842c3e9bb106266ce4545ea2d269bddb3569fedb15eb5c11ab53",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
